      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For symmetric relation, we must add&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>For transitive relation, we must add</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, number of new elements added<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>"
  }
